OL,3,GNEWSAPaedophile jailed over 'horrific'
OL,4,Asex attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paedophile who subjected three girls
OL,7,Fto "horrific" assaults has been jailed
OL,8,Fafter his crimes were uncovered when
OL,9,Fpolice searched his home.
OL,11,FWilliam Floyd, 28 and of no fixed
OL,12,Faddress, carried out the historic sex
OL,13,Fattacks in Peterborough, police said.
OL,15,FHe was jailed on Thursday after
OL,16,Fpleading guilty to six counts of rape,
OL,17,Ffive counts of sexual assault of a
OL,18,Fchild, three counts of assaulting a
OL,19,Fchild by penetration and a string of
OL,20,Fother offences.
