OL,5,
OL,6,FFloyd was sentenced to a total of 17
OL,7,Fyears in jail at Peterborough
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court, acting as a crown
OL,9,Fcourt, but will serve eight years and
OL,10,Fsix months in prison.
